<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador bank liquidity up 3.46 pct in Feb.</title>
<headline>Ecuador bank liquidity up 3.46 pct in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ecuador's Central Bank said Wednesday liquidity in the banking system grew 3.46 percent or 615 million sucres to 18.37 billion sucres in February.</p>
<p>At the end of January, bank liquidity stood at 17.76 billion sucres.</p>
<p>Total liquidity in the bank sector ended 1996 at 16.99 billion sucres, up 35.8 percent from 1995.</p>
<p>((--Gustavo Oviedo, Quito Newsroom, 5932 258433))</p>
</text>
